# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD A COMPLETE NEWBORN CLOTHING DROPSHIPPING E-COMMERCE WEBSITE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, e-commerce architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, security specialist, and dropshipping automation expert.

Build a complete, production-oriented newborn clothing e-commerce website using an AliExpress dropshipping business model.

This must be a real, functional online store, not merely a landing page, frontend mockup, or collection of nonfunctional buttons.

The store owner must be able to manage products, inventory, prices, discounts, orders, payments, shipping, announcements, popups, emails, and store settings from a secure admin dashboard without editing source code.

Build the customer-facing website, backend, persistent database, admin dashboard, and external-service integration points as one connected application.

